  "title": "The new CX challenge: Creating digital & data-led interactions",
  "summary": "Getting a 360-degree view of each of your customers is absolutely possible. If you pull in behavioural data, all social media interactions, all Trustpilot and app store reviews and all conversations, you can build powerful centralised model to drive better insight across your organisation. It will show what a customer’s sentiment and emotions are about the product, service and the digital journey. You can build a single customer view that can help you not just get to know your customers better and to create more personalised customer journeys, but to help reduce churn",
